porate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"PAT hit a record Rs 197 crore, a 10% margin, the highest ever.","quote":"Finally, PAT came in at a record INR197 crores, reaching 10% of revenue, our highest PAT margin ever","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Optical connectivity attach rate rose to 16% from 15% on a much larger cable revenue base.","quote":"we are pleased to share that our attach rates have increased to 16% on a much larger OFC revenue base compared to 15% last year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Gross margin is under pressure as war-related input costs pushed key raw material prices up sharply.","quote":"So, Tej, on the gross margin, yes, there is some sort of pressure which is coming from the input cost broadly with all the war situation, the prices of the key raw material getting increased to significant multiples.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Data centre and enterprise should reach 50% of revenue this fiscal, well above the earlier 30% guidance.","quote":"Looking ahead, we expect the combined data center and Enterprise segment to scale up to 50% of the revenues in the current fiscal, well above the 30% guidance provided in our previous earnings call.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"The order pipeline gives strong revenue visibility for the year.","quote":"This robust order pipeline provides strong revenue visibility and reinforces our growth outlook for the year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"EBITDA margin guidance was raised to 23% after the 20% target was already met in Q1.","quote":"which is up 184% year-on-year. We are now revising our EBITDA margin guidance upward to 23%.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company targets an attach rate above 20% from next quarter and 25% by year end.","quote":"Looking ahead, we are focused on further increasing our attach rate to above 20% from next quarter onwards and to 25% by the end of this financial year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Hyperscaler capex should continue, raising demand for STL's portfolio.","quote":"So we do continue to see that this capex will continue from the hyperscalers. And on the back of that, the demand for our portfolio will continue to increase.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Demand currently exceeds supply.","quote":"So it does seem to be that the demand is outstripping supply currently.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":17.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Polyethylene cost swings can largely be passed on to customers up to a point.","quote":"Largely, that ultimately is a cost for us at the cable level, and we feel fairly confident that up to a certain level that we are able to pass that on to our customers.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Input costs have risen.","quote":"There have been cost increases that Ajay spoke about in terms of our input costs.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":18.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"The margin upgrade comes from higher utilisation and better product and customer mix.","quote":"And in terms of the upgrade or to the margins, I think it's a combination of 2, 3 things. I think it is certainly some amount of improvement in our capacity utilization, a good product mix and customer mix","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":16.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Data centre solutions carry higher margins than the telecom segment.","quote":"yes, the margins broadly for the solutions we sell to data center are higher margins than the telecom segment.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":18.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"Capex is planned at about Rs 500 crore a year for three years, about Rs 1,500 crore in total.","quote":"We expect about INR500 crores of investment per year for the next 3 years. So cumulatively, around INR1,500 crores is what we see over the 3 years.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":15.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"The announced US investment is $100 million over five years.","quote":"So what we announced was a $100 million investment over a 5-year period.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":17.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"Capacity utilisation keeps improving quarter on quarter.","quote":"we continue to see that our capacity utilization is improving quarter-on-quarter. So that's a positive development, and we continue to see that going forward as well.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"The company is upgrading equipment and debottlenecking current operations to add output.","quote":"we are looking very closely at both upgrades of our equipment and machines, and we're also looking at debottlenecking from our current operations.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"Q1 order wins of Rs 13,100 crore were 1.7x the whole of last year's order wins.","quote":"In quarter 1 alone, we secured orders worth INR13,100 crores, which is 1.7x the total order wins of INR7,687 crores recorded in the entire financial year last year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"A multiyear $1.1 billion hyperscaler deal for AI data centre connectivity runs through FY29.","quote":"The momentum is anchored by a landmark multiyear $1.1 billion deal with a global hyperscaler to supply optical connectivity products for next-gen AI data centers through FY29.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"orders","statement":"The open order book reached a record Rs 18,618 crore, up 2.4x from last quarter.","quote":"Our open order book stands at a record high of INR18,618 crores, up 2.4x from the last quarter, reflecting healthy order inflows and a strong market confidence.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"Net cash is Rs 483 crore, making the company net debt free.","quote":"On balance sheet, the net cash balance stands at INR483 crores, achieving the status of net debt-free company.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"STL completed a Rs 1,500 crore QIP to fund growth.","quote":"STL successfully completed a landmark QIP of INR1,500 crores to fund our next phase of growth.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"75% of the QIP proceeds will go to debt reduction.","quote":"We are allocating 75% of proceeds towards reduction of debt, while the rest of it going towards general corporate purposes.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"STL won its European patent dispute with Fujikura.","quote":"we have secured definitive victory in a European patent dispute with Fujikura, and this matter has now been conclusively resolved in STL's favor.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"STL launched CONCAT, a spliceless plug-and-play product that cuts FTTH installation costs.","quote":"In optical connectivity, we launched CONCAT, a spliceless plug-and-play solution designed for dramatically lowering the FTTH installation costs.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"STL won US Conec certification for MMC pre-terminated solutions offering 3x cable density.","quote":"A major milestone this quarter is that we have achieved the elite US Conec certification for MMC Pre-Terminated solutions, delivering a massive 3x increase in cable density over traditional layouts","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"Data centres are the fastest-growing fibre demand driver, with optical cable demand from them seen up 63% in 2026.","quote":"Data centers are the fastest-growing driver of fiber demand. CRU projects a massive 63% global growth in optical cable demand from this segment in the year 2026 alone, driven by hyperscale expansion and AI workloads.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/STLTECH_28072026190327_SEintimationEarningscalltranscript_July2026.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"Global c